# [本地 fork] 上游忽略 lib/（源码仓库不存构建产物），但本 fork 要能 clone 即用，
# 所以改为跟踪 lib/。重新构建后记得把 lib/ 一并提交。
# 上游原规则: lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz
.DS_Store
coverage/
# Private evaluation sets are built from personal material and must never be
# committed or published (see the 0.2.12 changelog entry). Only templates ship.
eval/
scripts/eval-*.json
!scripts/eval-*.example.json
# Tesseract language data: downloaded on demand by the OCR fallback, never part of
# the project. A stray download put 7MB of it in the repository root once.
*.traineddata
# Issue responses and other per-report working notes stay local: they are written
# for a reporter, not for the published repository. Durable findings belong in
# CHANGELOG.md or docs/releases/, and the deferred list in docs/. The pattern is
# ignored rather than merely untracked so a later `git add -A` cannot pick it up.
docs/issues/
